w how many events occur in an interval of time (one hour).\n\n- Random variable III does *not* follow a Poisson distribution. There are no events that occur at a constant average rate, and there is no interval of time or space.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186419541 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186157308 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4f0a57c2-bbad-5225-976b-385c7f117738" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Random Variables that Follow a Poisson Distribution" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048934 :topic/id #uuid "cd3b7077-78e5-5eb6-880e-d8648790c6b0" :topic/math-academy-id 2838 :topic/title "Modeling With the Poisson Distribution"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a92e176d-3955-50fe-8147-44d2a591c6e7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472682} {:answer/id #uuid "d3604c50-1e5e-5384-a961-8aa6a3eae304" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472683}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a92e176d-3955-50fe-8147-44d2a591c6e7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472682} :answer-field/id #uuid "2b72f2bc-c09e-5bc5-885c-add4964c9b74" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473736} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7e369d76-1aae-55c7-a19d-61ffb59a914d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472684} {:answer/id #uuid "74afb83a-49b6-596f-9e6e-13eaafaa523a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472685}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "74