pe {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475043}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "ef7933ca-459a-5897-8c5b-5b08b877b68b" :question/math-academy-id "q-107838" :question/problem "Which of the following integrals are equivalent to $Γ(z)$ for $\\text{Re}(z)>0?$\n\nI. $3{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{{t}^{3z-1}}{{e}^{{t}^{3}}}\\,\\text{d}t$\n\nII. $3{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{3z-3}{e}^{-{t}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}t$\n\nIII. $3{\\int }_{1}^{\\infty }{t}^{3z-1}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the definition of the gamma function:\n\n$$\nΓ(z)={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{z-1}{e}^{-t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\text{Re}(z)>0.\n$$\n\nWith this definition in mind, let's consider each of the given integrals.\n\n- Integral I matches the definition. We use a substitution $s={t}^{3},$ then $3{t}^{2}\\,\\text{d}t=\\text{d}s.$ We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{3z-1}{e}^{-{t}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}t & =3{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{3(z-1)+2}{e}^{-{t}^{3}}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{t}^{3(z-1)}{e}^{-{t}^{3}}(3{t}^{2})\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{s}^{z-1}{e}^{-s}\\,\\text{d}s=Γ(z).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Integral II does *not* match the definition. The integrand ${t}^{3z-3}{e}^{-{t}^{3}}$ is not equivalent to that shown in the definition.\n\n- Integral III does *not* match the definition. The lower bound of integration does not match that given in the definition.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432784 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171934 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "cb0ae539-5348-5a2c-b226-c009ce6d6094" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 7" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050318 :topic/id #uuid "3f7c8941-2bc1-5431-84b6-f34e556ea057" :topic/math-academy-id 3543 :topic/title "Divisibility of Integers by 3, 9, 6, and 7"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "acaddc19-71fe-529b-8270-6f2e695f41b5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474744} {:answer/id #uuid "84d5ffe0-a191-5c87-8484-bec5589dd610" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474745}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "acaddc19-71fe-529b-8270-6f2e695f41b5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474744} :answer-field/id #uuid "43abff9b-0dbf-5577-9f83-67a65cc9c6a2" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475298} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dc465029-e1fb-538b-8e85-d0174018e3e0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474746} {:answer/id #uuid "019ee61a-4561-5588-afaa-c8b3bb41b5e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474747}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dc465029-e1fb-538b-8e85-d0174018e3e0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474746} :answer-field/id #uuid "60401644-f161-55b8-b551-e1e80727b7b1" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475299} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "580e8f79-6065-595a-a43f-e10b2f42fa9a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474748} {:answer/id #uuid "e50b94ef-8b70-56f2-a2da-c456b23eb5bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474749}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e50b94ef-8b70-56f2-a2da-c456b23eb5bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474749} :answer-field/id #uuid "d9f52a68-17c6-56ae-9df0-1ffe6b9d370b" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475300}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "1d92850b-bd66-52a9-a628-fb23ae6c0162" :question/math-academy-id "q-223458" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $7?$\n\nI. $276$\n\nII. $647$\n\nIII. $805$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To check if a number is divisible by $7,$ double the last digit, subtract the result from the remaining digits, and then check if the difference is divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $276,$ we have that \n\n$$\n27-2(6)=27-12=15\n$$\n\nwhich is not divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $276$ is not divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $647,$ we have that \n\n$$\n64-2(7)=64-14=50\n$$\n\nwhich is not divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $647$ is not divisible by $7.$\n\n- For the number $805,$ we have that \n\n$$\n80-2(5)=80-10=70\n$$\n\nwhich is divisible by $7.$ Therefore, $805$ is divisible by $7.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432785 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171933 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b483f9f7-47a9-5725-b1f1-fe0ea39a7e96" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 6" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050318 :topic/id #uuid "3f7c8941-2bc1-5431-84b6-f34e556ea057" :topic/math-academy-id 3543 :topic/title "Divisibility of Integers by 3, 9, 6, and 7"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3b3a1c18-402a-5826-bf79-0dba558c64fc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474332} {:answer/id #uuid "6c88f31b-1b8f-5242-b277-9bc33fcc1d53" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474333}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6c88f31b-1b8f-5242-b277-9bc33fcc1d53" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474333} :answer-field/id #uuid "bc5edc77-177d-5283-b4ed-f6d29e6130f3" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475092} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3717d0fa-e38b-5a2c-bc8b-96a33d55cf5a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474334} {:answer/id #uuid "a0899615-a369-5445-bb33-8c945624b783" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474335}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a0899615-a369-5445-bb33-8c945624b783" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474335} :answer-field/id #uuid "c5341e31-a447-5b11-b208-298c154fcdea" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475093} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "16a85a5c-42ba-5e88-a569-6fb4ddc389eb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474336} {:answer/id #uuid "14c3560a-8a2d-5432-9a2c-f7b3ac672b40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474337}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "14c3560a-8a2d-5432-9a2c-f7b3ac672b40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474337} :answer-field/id #uuid "5d54dde0-4790-50de-af67-f644fa4e8182" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475094}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "245a9f1f-3fc0-594c-a273-205b94f4bf02" :question/math-academy-id "q-132405" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are divisible by $6?$\n\nI. $185\\,346$\n\nII. $2\\,525\\,934$\n\nIII. $15\\,070\\,962$\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A number is divisible by $6$ if it is divisible by both $2$ and $3.$\n\n- The number $185\\,346$ is divisible by $2,$ and it is also divisible by $3$ since the sum of its digits is divisible by $3:$\n\n$$\n1+8+5+3+4+6=27\n$$\n\nSo, $185\\,346$ is divisible by $6.$\n\n- The number $2\\,525\\,934$ is divisible by $2,$ and it is also divisible by $3$ since the sum of its digits is divisible by $3:$\n\n$$\n2+5+2+5+9+3+4=30\n$$\n\nSo, $2\\,525\\,934$ is divisible by $6.$\n\n- The number $15\\,070\\,962$ is divisible by $2,$ and it is also divisible by $3$ since the sum of its digits is divisible by $3:$\n\n$$\n1+5+0+7+0+9+6+2=30\n$$\n\nSo, $15\\,070\\,962$ is divisible by $6.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186432786 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171933 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b483f9f7-47a9-5725-b1f1-fe0ea39a7e96" :knowledge-point/title "Determining if a Number Is Divisible by 6" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050318 :topic/id #uuid "3f7c8941-2bc1-5431-84b6-f34e556ea057" :topic/math-academy-id 3543 :topic/title "Divisibility of I