emy-id "q-98369" :question/problem "Which of the following numbers are integers?\n\nI. $\\frac{3}{2}$\n\nII. $-3$\n\nIII. $5$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "The integers consist of all positive and negative whole numbers and zero.\n\n$$\n…,-3,\\,-2,\\,-1,\\,0,\\,1,\\,2,\\,3,…\n$$\n\n \n\nOf the given numbers, $-3$ and $5$ are integers, but $\\frac{3}{2}$ is not.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" :step/_content [{:activity/_steps {:activity/scope {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049935 :topic/id #uuid "1fcf3c5f-af9e-5e5e-b7aa-ff9b3a312835" :topic/math-academy-id 2558 :topic/title "Natural Numbers, Integers, and Rational Numbers"} :activity/title "Natural Numbers, Integers, and Rational Numbers" :activity/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :activity.type/review} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186433582} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186433615}]} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186433610 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152125 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ebf3f930-2768-5399-8470-48ac430065a3" :knowledge-point/title "Classifying Numbers as Integers" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049935 :topic/id #uuid "1fcf3c5f-af9e-5e5e-b7aa-ff9b3a312835" :topic/math-academy-id 2558 :topic/title "Natural Numbers, Integers, and Rational Numbers"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bf08aba8-f0da-51fd-ad95-8655627dd121" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475014} {:answer/id #uuid "7d0aa0db-a2a7-5129-a388-9c57ac3f39d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475015}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7d0aa0db-a2a7-5129-a388-9c57ac3f39d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186475015} :answer-field/id #uuid "227c914e-b720-542d-b308-cc175cdab060" :a